Oh-ho do it, do it, Oh-ho do it now,

362
00:31:38,702 --> 00:31:43,702
心の声が木霊する
The voice of my heart echoes out.

363
00:31:44,162 --> 00:31:48,562
涙と希望のカーニバル
A carnival of tears and hope.

364
00:31:49,122 --> 00:31:54,922
生意気くらいの夜明けに
In a dawn as sassy as this.

365
00:31:55,602 --> 00:31:57,602
揺らすんだ…
Shake it up...

366
00:31:58,602 --> 00:32:00,602
揺らすんだ…
Shake it up...

367
00:32:01,102 --> 00:32:03,602
進むんだ…
Move forward...

368
00:32:04,102 --> 00:32:06,602
進むんだ…
Move forward...

369
00:32:07,602 --> 00:32:12,602
サラバ、昨日をぬぎすてて 勇気の声をとれ
Farewell, shed yesterday and take up the voice of courage.

370
00:32:13,102 --> 00:32:18,102
「じぶん」という名の愛を知るために
To know the love called 'myself'.

371
00:32:18,602 --> 00:32:22,102
眠れない羊の群れよ
O flock of sleepless sheep,

372
00:32:22,602 --> 00:32:29,602
迷える心の叫びを 振り返るな 我らの世界はまだ始まったばかりだ
Don't look back at the cries of a straying heart, our world has only just begun.

373
00:32:30,102 --> 00:32:34,102
始まったばかりだ
Only just begun.

374
00:32:36,602 --> 00:32:47,602
Ah-Ha Dig it, Dig it, Ah-Ha Dig it, Dig it

375
00:32:48,102 --> 00:32:56,602
Oh-ho do it, do it, Oh-ho do it, do it

376
