落ちた小鳥にそっと触れるような悲しみをください
Give me a sorrow like gently touching a fallen little bird.

379
00:33:31,582 --> 00:33:35,582
涙ぐんで見下ろして かわいそうだと口に出して
Look down with tearful eyes and call it pitiful.

380
00:33:35,582 --> 00:33:41,582
靴の先で転がしても構わないわ 汚れていてもいいからと
You can kick me with the tip of your shoe, even if I'm filthy.

381
00:33:41,582 --> 00:33:46,082
泥だらけの手を取って ねぇ輪になって踊りましょう
Take my mud-covered hand, hey, let's form a circle and dance.

382
00:33:46,082 --> 00:33:51,082
目障りな有象無象は全て食べてしまいましょう
Let's devour all the annoying riffraff.

383
00:33:51,082 --> 00:33:55,082
スパイスは堪え難いくらいがいいわ
The spice should be hard to bear.

384
00:33:55,082 --> 00:34:02,082
lie, lie, lie, la la la...

385
00:34:02,082 --> 00:34:06,582
怯えた小鳥は さよならなんて言えなくて
The frightened little bird couldn't even say goodbye.

386
00:34:06,582 --> 00:34:10,582
愛を乞う仕草で黙り込んで つつましいつもりでいた
Remaining silent with gestures begging for love, thinking it was modest.

387
00:34:10,582 --> 00:34:17,582
lie, lie, it’s a lie, not a lie, もう辛い
lie, lie, it’s a lie, not a lie, it's already too painful.

388
00:34:17,582 --> 00:34:22,582
散々傷ついて やさしいせかいに誰だって行きたいわ
Hurt over and over, anyone would want to go to a gentle world.

389
00:34:22,582 --> 00:34:28,082
ひとつに溶けてしまいましょう 憎しみも愛情もむしゃむしゃと
Let's melt together into one, greedily devouring both hatred and affection.

390
00:34:28,082 --> 00:34:33,582
頬張ってしまいましょう 混沌の甘い甘い壺の中で
Let's stuff our cheeks in the sweet, sweet pot of chaos.

391
00:34:33,582 --> 00:34:39,582
lie, lie, lie, la la la...

392
00:34:39,582 --> 00:34:44,582
曖昧に笑うから 会いたいと思うのよ
You smile so ambiguously, which is why I want to see you.

393
00:34:44,582 --> 00:34:49,582
I know you’re here to stay with me 愛されていたいだけ
I know you’re here to stay with me, I just want to be loved.

394
00:34:49,582 --> 00:34:54,082
lie, lie, lie, you’re to be with me

395
00:34:54,082 --> 00:34:59,082
雷鳴の咲くところ 惨憺たる heavenly feeling
Where thunder blooms, a dismal heavenly feeling.

396
00:35:00,178 --> 00:35:01,198
あわれみを下さい
Have mercy on me,

397
00:35:01,198 --> 00:35:02,458
愁いも愛情も
and sorrow and affection too,

398
00:35:02,458 --> 00:35:04,348
むしゃむしゃと頬張ってしまいましょう
gobbling them all up.

399
00:35:07,808 --> 00:35:09,156
混沌の
In the chaos...

400
00:35:09,668 --> 00:35:14,708
甘い甘い壺の中で
In a jar of sweet, sweet chaos...

401
00:35:16,456 --> 00:35:22,056
ライラライララララ…
Lie, lie, lie, la la la...

402
00:35:23,556 --> 00:35:29,056
ライラライララララ…
Lie, lie, lie, la la la...

403
00:35:31,306 --> 00:35:33,906
逢いには折れそうだから
Because I'm about to break when we meet,

404
00:35:33,906 --> 00:35:37,906
逢いたいと思うのよ
I find myself wanting to see you.

405
00:35:38,256 --> 00:35:41,556
I know you're here to stay with me

406
00:35:41,906 --> 00:35:45,156
愛されていたいだけ
I just want to be loved.

407
00:35:45,856 --> 00:35:48,906
lie, lie, lie, you're to be with me

408
00:35:49,256 --> 00:35:52,606
雷鳴の咲くところ
Where thunder blooms,

409
00:35:52,806 --> 00:35:56,556
惨憺たる heavenly feeling
a wretched, heavenly feeling.

410
00:35:57,006 --> 00:36:00,406
愛だけ残ればいい
It's fine if only love remains.

411
00:36:21,956 --> 00:36:25,156
しんしんと悲しみ
Quietly, only sorrow

412
00:36:25,556 --> 00:36:29,856
だけが降り積もる
